@baseUrl = http://<INGRESS_ADDRESS>

### Display the todo application
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: text/html

### Fetch the cached image
GET {{baseUrl}}/image
Accept: image/jpeg

### Shut down the application process
POST {{baseUrl}}/shutdown

### Check liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz
Accept: application/json

### Check readiness: backend and database connection
GET {{baseUrl}}/readyz
Accept: application/json

### Break the application until the liveness probe restarts its container
POST {{baseUrl}}/break
Accept: text/html

